---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | Consultant Client Ops" description="Privacy policy for Consultant Client Ops.">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-14 prose-doc">
    <h1 class="text-4xl mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-ink-500 text-sm mb-8">Last updated: July 7, 2026</p>

    <h2>1. What this site collects</h2>
    <p>This site uses privacy-respecting analytics to understand which pages are useful (see Section 3) and, where enabled, an embedded AI chat widget to answer product questions. Our free calculators and the Scope of Work generator run entirely in your browser — nothing you type into them is sent to or stored on our servers.</p>

    <h2>2. Payment information</h2>
    <p>All purchases are processed by Gumroad. We do not collect or store your payment card details directly — Gumroad's own privacy policy governs data collected during checkout.</p>

    <h2>3. Analytics</h2>
    <p>We use privacy-focused analytics (such as Plausible or a similarly cookie-light provider) to see aggregate traffic to pages, without tracking individuals across other sites.</p>

    <h2>4. Chat widget</h2>
    <p>If enabled, questions you type into the on-site chat widget are sent to our third-party AI chat provider to generate an answer from our published FAQ content. Avoid entering sensitive personal information into the chat widget.</p>

    <h2>5. Your rights</h2>
    <p>You can request details of any data associated with your purchase (via your Gumroad order) at any time through the contact options on your order confirmation.</p>

    <h2>6. Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy periodically; the current version is always posted at this URL.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
